    "note": "v2.9 (2026-03-23): Added FR-26 (Isometric Hold: The Hidden Cost of Equilibrium), SA-8 (Cognitive Synthesis Self-Model: Process + Trauma + AI), EV-10 (CRE 2026 Market Data); amended FR-2 (Rates vs. Levels sub-dimension). Source: Thomas / Gemini conversation 2026-03-23: _CRE Market Faces Debt Maturity Wall.md. v2.8 (2026-03-23): Added FR-24 (Functional Discourse) and FR-25 (Taxonomy of Capacity Failure). Source: Thomas / Claude session 2026-03-23. v2.7 (2026-03-21): Added DB-25 (Conscription as Electoral Equalizer: The Structural Case for Universal Draft). Source: Socratic debate session, 2026-03-21. v2.6 (2026-03-19): Added EV-9 (ACE Study: adverse childhood experiences → long-term health outcomes; Felitti et al. 1998) and DB-24 (Harm-Avoidance Institutional Frames Produce the Harm They Prohibit). Source: Thomas's essay on 'Do No Harm' vs. 'Reduce Suffering'. v2.5 (2026-03-17): REC-1 corrected BTN-11 cross-graph citation in FR-21 and T-11 (wrong node — MASTER BTN-11 is 'Determined Past vs. Possible Future', not resistance typology; correct book-graph nodes for Living in Truth / resistance typology are C-63, C-81, A-38, BFR-25); REC-4 BS-5 stale FR-10 reference updated to FR-8 (FR-10 was absorbed into FR-8 at v1.4); REC-5 FP-7 and FR-7 gap stubs added to document intentional/unexplained ID gaps; REC-6 DB-11 successor_note added pointing to DB-22; REC-7 DB-4 notes updated to replace retired FR-10 ref with FR-8; REC-8 FP-16 B-1 informal reference formalized to C-23 (book-graph Promise Trauma concept). v2.4 (2026-03-16): Added T-12 (FP-9 vs. FP-10 tension), DB-19 (Climate), DB-20 (Mass Incarceration), DB-21 (Immigration), DB-22 (AI Governance), DB-23 (Education); added FP-10 missing edges; added SA-4↔SA-6 rationalization loop edge. v2.3 (2026-03-16): Added DB-18 (Reconciliation Requires Architectural Change, Not Time). Source: _Boundaries of Asymmetric Witnessing.md; session analysis 2026-03-16. v2.2 (2026-03-15): Added DB-17 (Book as Witness Record, Not Persuasion Project) and SA-7 (Capacity Constraint: cPTSD, Resource Depletion, and the Requirement to Be Safe). Source: Thomas's stated positions 2026-03-15 and 20260215 Friend S conversation. v2.1 (2026-03-15): Namespace-resolved — Book Master T-11 citations updated to BTN-11 (matching KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH_PTSD_Book__MASTER__20260315.md BFR-/BTN- prefix convention). text fields are debate-ready summaries. Full prose lives in the .md source. Retired nodes retained with status field for edge-reference integrity. v1.9: added FR-19 (Negative Capability), SA-6 (Outcome Attachment); amended FP-10 (integration requirement), FR-8 (cognitive cascade), T-11 (Living in Truth political practice); missing structural edges added based on graph audit. v2.0 — cross-graph integration session (2026-03-14): (a) FP-11 amended with manufactured-fear distinction; (b) FP-15 amended with market-failure framing; (c) New node FP-16: Promise Trauma; (d) New node FR-20: Truth as Scarce Commodity; (e) New node FR-21: Living in Truth as Political Practice (elevated from T-11 note); (f) New node FR-22: Cultural Pathology Patterns; (g) New node FR-23: Collective Solidarity vs. Individual Obligation. Source: cross-graph analysis with KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH_PTSD_Book__MASTER__20260314.md."
