      "label": "Obligation Precedes Intelligence",
      "text": "No authority without accepting consequence. Intelligence alone confers no credibility. Obligation can be accepted, declined, or atrophied — atrophy is structural incapacity, not mere refusal.",
      "notes": ""
    },
