      "text": "Every major pathology = failure to bind present actions to future consequences. Trauma=collapse, Certainty=freeze, Denial=defer, Cowardice=refuses extension, Populism=reversal, Emergency=compression, Algorithms=monetize, High discount rate=prices future near zero.",
